Subject: [PATCH 119/119] PC5: a console program without a window takes its title (Wine
 patch 0951)

Streets of Rage 4 sets .NET's Console.Title first thing; started without a
console window, as every game is, SetConsoleTitleW failed and .NET threw
before the game started. It now succeeds, with nowhere to show the title.
